                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">FOUR TYPES OF HEALTHCARE DATA</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">One encounter generates all four</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"180\" width=\"500\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">ADMINISTRATIVE</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">UB-04 claims</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">CMS-1500 forms</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Demographics</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Insurance eligibility</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Scheduling, billing</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Source: practice management,</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">billing systems</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"180\" width=\"480\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">CLINICAL</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">EHR documentation</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Lab and imaging results</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Medication admin records</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Vital signs, nursing notes</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Disease registries</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Source: EHR, ancillary</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">systems, registries</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"590\" width=\"500\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">FINANCIAL</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Charges and payments</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Adjustments, write-offs</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Bad debt</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"805\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Cost reports</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Payroll</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Source: revenue cycle,</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"930\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">general ledger</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"590\" width=\"480\" height=\"380\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"650\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">PATIENT-REPORTED</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">HCAHPS survey responses</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">PROMs (outcome measures)</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Portal messages</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"805\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">SDOH questionnaires</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Wearable device data</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Source: survey vendors,</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"930\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">portals, wearables</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "The four data categories every HIM professional must master"
